Subject: [PATCH] Link hand-over: solve and show a handed-over geometry
 (src/fork/handover.js)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Proposed by kisi (riehlies/kisi, web/advanced/fork-patches/, its "Fields…"): the
original's #params= link plus solve=1, view=, mode=, exc=, title=, editor=hide; each step
reported to the opening page by postMessage. Uses the page's DOM and window.forkPlot only;
one hook (the module's script tag).
